                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}1+27+125+\\cdots+(2k-1)^3+(2(k+1)-1)^3\\\\{}&=(k+1)^2\\bigl(2(k+1)^2-1\\bigr)\\\\{}&=2k^4+8k^3+11k^2+6k+1\\end{aligned}",
